---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import wordmark from '../assets/brand/wordmark.png';
import wordmarkDark from '../assets/brand/wordmark-dark.png';
import sunFlourish from '../assets/brand/sun-flourish.png';
import sunset from '../assets/brand/stamps/sunset.png';
import sunStamp from '../assets/elements/made-by-a-human-fa-sun-signature-stamp.png';
import portrait from '../assets/brand/finn-portrait.png';

const explore = [
  { href: '/work', label: 'Work', body: 'Collage, painting and mixed media, by chapter.' },
  { href: '/exhibitions', label: 'Exhibitions', body: 'The gallery track, 2015–2024.' },
  { href: '/tools', label: 'Tools', body: 'Small machines that make.' },
];
---
<BaseLayout title="Finn Astle" register="art">
  <section class="hero">
    <img class="stamp" src={sunset.src} alt="" aria-hidden="true"
      style="top:-0.5rem; right:-0.5rem; width:112px; transform:rotate(7deg);" />

    <p class="label" style="color: var(--graphite); margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">Finn Astle · Astle Creative</p>
    <h1 class="duality">Fearless <span class="amp">&amp;</span> Answers</h1>
    <p class="hero-sub">Copywriter and practising visual artist. Working one question:
      what happens to making when machines can make.</p>
  </section>

  <img class="flourish" src={sunFlourish.src} alt="" aria-hidden="true" />

  <div class="wordmark-card">
    <img class="stamp stamp--ink" src={sunStamp.src} alt="" aria-hidden="true"
      style="top:-1.6rem; right:1rem; width:64px; transform:rotate(6deg);" />
    <img class="wordmark-light" src={wordmark.src} alt="Finn Astle, hand-brushed collage wordmark" />
    <img class="wordmark-dark" src={wordmarkDark.src} alt="" aria-hidden="true" />
  </div>

  <p><em>is currently searching fearlessly for answers.</em></p>

  <p>F.A. turns up everywhere on this site before you're told what it stands for.
    Finn Astle on the invoices, Fearless Answers on the studio work, and no tidy
    way to pick just one thing for it to mean. Most days it's both at once.</p>

  <p>The modern creative is hard to catch in a sentence because they refuse to be
    one thing. Copywriter, painter, occasional collagist of whatever's left in the
    gutter. Freedom needs a frame, expression needs strategy, so he picked both
    and called it a practice (mostly to justify the paint).</p>

  <p>What's left after that is half shared and half expressed, the letters that
    never got sent, and a website that's mostly an experiment in polite
    disappearance.</p>

  <p>Let this be a statement of my intention: a place to publish with impermanence
    in mind first, because the weight of free expression costs too much.</p>

  <nav class="explore" aria-label="Explore the site">
    {explore.map((e) => (
      <a class="explore-card" href={e.href}>
        <span class="explore-label">{e.label}</span>
        <span class="explore-body">{e.body}</span>
      </a>
    ))}
  </nav>

  <hr />

  <p>Some day this will be a place to see.</p>

  <p>If you stayed this long you are either very lost or precisely where you meant
    to be. Email and commissions live elsewhere, but if the internet is a
    born-lonely city, consider this an alley you can shout into. I will answer
    sometimes and ignore you other times, and both are part of the plan.</p>

  <div class="sign-off">
    <Image class="portrait" src={portrait} alt="Finn Astle" width={96} height={96} />
    <p>Finn</p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .explore {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(180px, 1fr));
    gap: 1rem;
    margin: 2.5rem 0;
  }
  .explore-card {
    display: block;
    position: relative;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    padding: 1.1rem 1.2rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: inherit;
    transition: border-color 0.2s ease, transform 0.2s ease;
  }
  .explore-card:hover { border-color: var(--accent); }
  .explore-label {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
  }
  .explore-card:hover .explore-label { color: var(--accent); }
  .explore-body {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--graphite);
  }
  /* Subtle desktop hover affordance: an arrow that slides in, and a small lift. */
  .explore-card::after {
    content: "→";
    position: absolute;
    top: 1.1rem;
    right: 1.2rem;
    font-family: var(--sans);
    color: var(--accent);
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateX(-0.35rem);
    transition: opacity 0.2s ease, transform 0.2s ease;
  }
  @media (hover: hover) {
    .explore-card:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); }
    .explore-card:hover::after { opacity: 1; transform: translateX(0); }
  }

  .sign-off {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.9rem;
    margin-top: -0.5rem;
  }
  .sign-off .portrait {
    width: 48px;
    height: 48px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    object-fit: cover;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .sign-off p { margin: 0; }
</style>
